  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Over in the Claude Monet kitchen, Chef Barinov has a problem that has nothing to do with love: somebody thawed a pile of cod, and it all has to be sold today. He gathers the staff and pulls in Sasha, one of the waitresses, to help. Listen to it in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "barinov",
   "t": "Внимание, повара! Начнём наше собрание.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
